%abc-2.1
% CONTROL — %%visualTranspose, the last of the three directives the 2026-08-15 sweep named.
% It sets `multilineVars.globalTranspose` and every pitch is shifted AT PARSE TIME, key
% signature and spelling with it (`abc_parse.js:529-536`, `abc_transpose.js`). We ignore it
% entirely, so these rows are a NAMED DEFECT rather than a regression. Goldens generated by
% running abcjs 6.7.0 at {staffwidth: 670}.
X:1
T:visualTranspose 0 — the control's control
L:1/4
M:4/4
%%visualTranspose 0
K:C
CDEF|GABc|

X:2
T:visualTranspose up 2
L:1/4
M:4/4
%%visualTranspose 2
K:C
CDEF|GABc|

X:3
T:visualTranspose down 3, with accidentals
L:1/4
M:4/4
%%visualTranspose -3
K:D
^FGA^c|d^cBA|

X:4
T:visualTranspose up 7, minor
L:1/4
M:4/4
%%visualTranspose 7
K:Em
EFGA|Bcde|
